=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Sylvie} at {z:Western Adoulin} Waterfront (I-5) Waypoint #9 to begin the quest.
** {p:Geomancer} must be set as your main job to activate the quest. Can be completed by on any job.
* Obtain 3x {i:Acuex Ore|Acuex Ore|4042} and trade them to {p:Sylvie}.
** {i:Acuex Ore|Acuex Ore|4042} can be purchased from the auction house, materials > smithing or farmed from {m:Putrid Acuex} and {m:Flatus Acuex} in {z:Cirdas Caverns}.
* Next, head to M-8/9 in {z:Cirdas Caverns} and examine the **Overgrown Grave** (on the ground, to the right of the Ergon Locus) for another cutscene.
** {z:Cirdas Caverns} - {p:Augural Conveyor} is the fastest warp, otherwise {z:Yorcia Weald} Frontier Station.
** A {p:Colonization Reive} @ M-8 may block the way and will need to be cleared to reach the grave.
* Speak to {n:Nhili Uvolep} at {z:Eastern Adoulin} (I-7), Sverdhried Hillock Waypoint #7, for a cutscene and your reward.

